  "notes": "{現|あらわ}れる means to appear or emerge, used for people, symptoms, results, etc.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: ⟦{自動詞|じどうし}→自動詞：10977_jidoushi⟧ (intransitive)\n- Pair: ⟦{現|あらわ}す→現す：02097_arawasu⟧ (transitive, to reveal/show)\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- ⟦{人|ひと}→人：00476_hito⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{現|あらわ}れる: a person appears\n- ⟦{症状|しょうじょう}→症状：03234_shoujou⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{現|あらわ}れる: symptoms appear\n- ⟦{結果|けっか}→結果：02486_kekka⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{現|あらわ}れる: results show\n- ⟦{効果|こうか}→効果：02726_kouka⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{現|あらわ}れる: effects appear\n\nALTERNATE KANJI:\nSometimes written as ⟦{表|あらわ}れる→表れる：14276_arawareru⟧ (same meaning).\n\nSIMILAR:\n- ⟦{出|で}る→出る：00513_deru⟧: to come out\n- ⟦{見|み}える→見える：01165_mieru⟧: to be visible",
